# No Cursor git attribution

Never add any of the following to commit messages, PR bodies, or code comments:

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor`
- `Co-authored-by: cursoragent@cursor.com`
- `Made with Cursor`
- `Made-with: Cursor`

Commit messages must be authored only as the repository user. Do not append attribution trailers.
